DESCRIPTION:The Glee Karaoke night is an all out celebration of the semina
 l cult classic televison show\, Glee. There will be karaoke\, a costume c
 ontest for the best Glee themed costume\, food\, and a screening of the G
 lee 3D Concert film. We will sing\, dance\, eat\, and laugh as we all get
  to relive what an important show Glee has been for so many\, and remains
  to be important today.\nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, activit
 ies\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all
  IU students and other members of the Indiana University community.\n\nHo
 sted by: Indiana Memorial Union Board\n\nAdditional Information can be fo
 und at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12904768
