DESCRIPTION:Calling all savvy shoppers and student vendors!\nBYOB @ IU wel
 comes all students to showcase their businesses at our bi-weekly events\,
  currently held at Dunn Meadow. While sellers must be IU students\, our e
 vents are open to the wider Bloomington community. You’ll find a diverse 
 range of student-run businesses offering everything from vintage clothing
  and jewelry to art prints\, plants\, and crochet items. Set up your tabl
 e\, set your prices\, and engage with various shoppers.\nOur events highl
 ight the creativity and entrepreneurial spirit of our members while provi
 ding invaluable real-world experience in marketing\, negotiating\, and cu
 stomer interaction. BYOB @ IU is more than just an organization—it's a mo
 vement dedicated to empowering the next generation of entrepreneurs\, hel
 ping them bring their ideas to life and connect with a broader audience.\
 n\nHosted by: Bring Your Own Business\n\nAdditional Information can be fo
 und at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12963235
DTEND:20261115T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20261114T061319Z
DTSTART:20261115T170000Z
LOCATION:IMU Alumni Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
