DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\nThis tabling event encourages students to reflect on t
 he people\, experiences\, and opportunities they are grateful for during 
 the Thanksgiving season. Participants can write what they're thankful for
  on a card or sticky note and add it to a gratitude display. This activit
 y promotes positivity\, community\, and appreciation while giving student
 s a chance to share messages of gratitude with others on campus.\n\n\n\n\
 n \n \n\nHosted by: You See Me\n\nAdditional Information can be found at:
