DESCRIPTION:\nImprove your English-speaking skills and learn from native s
 peakers who are eager to share their knowledge of the language. \n\n\nSes
 sions focus on topics like slang\, holidays\, and American culture in gen
 eral. No reservations are necessary—stop by and join us anytime. We meet 
 twice a week during the semester on Mondays and Wednesdays. For Fall 2026
 \, PET will begin on September 16th\, with all sessions held in-person at
  the Ferguson International Center\, Room 423.\nIs English your first lan
 guage? Have you been speaking it so long that it may as well be? Become a
  tutor and help international students at IUB become more comfortable wri
 ting\, reading\, and speaking English. Engage in IU’s global network and 
 make connections that last a lifetime.\nYou can also sign up to practice 
 your conversational English skills as a participant. Register and join th
 e email list HERE. \n\n\nHosted by: \n\nAdditional Information can be fou
 nd at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12670143
