DESCRIPTION:In partnership with the Mathematics Graduate Student Associati
 on and the Association for Women in Mathematics at IU\, Prime Time is a m
 ath-centered mentoring and networking dinner that brings together undergr
 aduate students\, graduate students\, and faculty for an evening of food\
 , games\, and conversation. Participants will enjoy dinner while engaging
  in conversation and math activities\, including puzzles\, logic challeng
 es\, and collaborative games. Whether you are passionate about math or si
 mply looking to meet new people\, Prime Time offers a fun and welcoming w
 ay to connect with members of the mathematics community\, explore math be
 yond the classroom\, and build meaningful relationships.\nAll Indiana Uni
 versity events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and h
 istorical observances welcome all IU students and other members of the In
 diana University community.\n\nHosted by: Association for Women in Mathem
 atics at Indiana University\, Indiana Memorial Union Board\, Mathematics 
 Graduate Student Association\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: h
 ttps://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12826304
