 udents grow competency across the 8 domains of the Student Leadership Com
 petencies.\nWhether you're new to leadership or already involved on campu
 s\, the Leadership Compass offers practical tools and meaningful conversa
 tions to elevate your leadership journey.\n📅 November 19th\, 2026⏰ 12:00
  PM – 2:30 PM📍 IMU Club Hub\n \nThe last 30 minutes of this event will b
 e dedicated to student leader training for those attending to fulfill the
 ir 2026 Student Leader Summit requirements. Students attending for this p
 urpose must attend the full event in addition to these 30 minutes to rece
 ive credit.\nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and ed
 ucational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students
  and other members of the Indiana University community.\n\nHosted by: Ind
 iana Memorial Union\, Student Involvement and Leadership\n\nAdditional In
 formation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12629561
