DESCRIPTION:\nJoin German Club for an interactive game night featuring Kah
 oot and Jeopardy! Test your knowledge of German-speaking countries\, thei
 r cultures\, traditions\, history\, language\, and more while enjoying so
 me friendly competition. \nThroughout the event\, questions and conversat
 ions will be in both English and German\, making this a great opportunity
  to hear German\, practice your language skills\, and build confidence sp
 eaking with friends and new people. Whether you're fluent in German\, jus
 t beginning to learn\, or have never spoken a word of German before\, eve
 ryone is welcome! No prior German knowledge is necessary to participate. 
 \nNew to German Club? We'd love to meet you! First-timers are always welc
 ome\, and there are no membership dues\, attendance requirements\, or fee
 s to participate in our events. Whether you're interested in learning Ger
 man\, exploring different cultures or just meeting new people\, you're we
 lcome to join us whenever you can!\nWe can't wait to see you there :)\n\n
 Hosted by: German Club at IU\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: h
 ttps://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12950212
