DESCRIPTION:Students will come together in the floor lounge for a vision b
 oard collage night accompanied by pie. Residents will have the opportunit
 y to reflect on their personal aspirations\, future goals\, and the exper
 iences they hope to pursue. Through conversation and collaboration with t
 heir peers\, students will be encouraged to share their ambitions and con
 sider new perspectives. Magazines\, canvases\, scissors\, and other craft
 ing materials will be provided to help residents creatively visualize the
 ir futures. Ultimately\, this program aims to foster personal reflection\
 , meaningful connections\, and a supportive environment in which students
  can explore their goals and aspirations.\n\nHosted by: \n\nAdditional In
 formation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12969448
