DESCRIPTION:Once associated with older generations\, Mahjong has now found
  a new home among the young. Social clubs have emerged dedicated to playi
 ng Mahjong to reconnect with culture and\, more importantly\, to foster n
 ew friendships. At the ACC\, we offer a casual and informal Mahjong exper
 ience\, perfect for those looking to learn the game\, take a break from t
 he digital world\, and most importantly\, meet new friends in person. You
  do not need to be an expert to join us\, just bring your enthusiasm and 
 a willingness to learn!\n \nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, acti
 vities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observances welcome 
 all IU students and other members of the Indiana University community.\n\
 nHosted by: Asian Culture Center\n\nAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12898215
