DESCRIPTION:\nImprove your English-speaking skills and learn from native s
 peakers who are eager to share their knowledge of the language. \n \n\n\n
 Sessions focus on topics like slang\, holidays\, and American culture in 
 general. No reservations are necessary—stop by and join us anytime. We me
 et twice a week during the semester on Mondays and Wednesdays. For Fall 2
 026\, PET will begin on September 16th\, with all sessions held in-person
  at the Ferguson International Center\, Room 423.\n \nIs English your fir
 st language? Have you been speaking it so long that it may as well be? Be
 come a tutor and help international students at IUB become more comfortab
 le writing\, reading\, and speaking English. Engage in IU’s global networ
 k and make connections that last a lifetime.\n \nYou can also sign up to 
 practice your conversational English skills as a participant. Register an
 d join the email list HERE. \n\n\nHosted by: \n\nAdditional Information c
 an be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12933847
