DESCRIPTION:The holiday season can bring joy\, but it can also bring feeli
 ngs of grief\, loss\, and change. Join us for The Art of Letting Go\, a c
 reative and reflective wellness event designed to help you navigate diffi
 cult emotions during the holidays. Through art\, reflection\, and connect
 ion\, explore ways to honor what you've experienced\, release what no lon
 ger serves you\, and make space for your feelings. Whether you're process
 ing a loss\, navigating change\, or simply looking for a moment of peace\
 , this event offers a supportive space to pause\, reflect\, and care for 
 yourself.\n\nHosted by: Health Promotion\n\nAdditional Information can be
  found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12785034
DTEND:20261204T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20261114T061319Z
DTSTART:20261203T210000Z
