CATEGORIES:Emotional Wellness
CATEGORIES:Social Wellness
DESCRIPTION:Feeling well is an ongoing journey - join us on the first Mond
 ay of every month to work on your wellness!\nOur workshops are engaging a
 nd interactive - no lectures here. You will learn new skills and have a c
 hance to share your concerns\, if you choose. We are here to help you dev
 elop skills that will take you from IU into the future.\nSeptember: Stres
 s Management\nBuild your stress management strengths! Understand more abo
 ut how stress can impact your life and what you can do to take control.\n
 October: Time Management\nLife doesn't have to be a crush - learn how to 
 manage your time and get some back for yourself\nNovember: Supporting Eac
 h Other\nHow can we help each other as we navigate challenges? Learn how 
 to identify when a friend might need help and steps to take to start the 
 conversation.\nDecember: Mindfulness and Meditation\nLearn five-minute me
 ditations\, and try out relaxation stations to learn skills to build your
  chill.\n \n\nHosted by: Health Promotion\n\nAdditional Information can b
 e found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12641333
DTEND:20261207T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20261114T061319Z
DTSTART:20261207T170000Z
GEO:39.172430;-86.515960
LOCATION:Wellness House
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:First Mondays Wellness Workshops
UID:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12641333
URL:https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12641333
X-HOSTS:Health Promotion
END:VEVENT
