DESCRIPTION:Join Friends of Médecins Sans Frontières (Doctors Without Bord
 ers) at Indiana University for our first General Body Meeting on December
  8th at 7:00 PM! Come meet our executive board\, learn about our mission\
 , and explore upcoming volunteer opportunities\, fundraising events\, and
  our plans for an international humanitarian trip this summer. We also ho
 pe to host a hands-on hygiene kit-making activity to support individuals 
 in need\, pending funding approval. This is a great opportunity to meet o
 ther members\, get involved\, and help make a difference locally and glob
 ally. All majors are welcome\, and no prior experience is needed! Locatio
 n will be announced soon.\n\nHosted by: Friends of Médecins Sans Frontièr
 es at Indiana University\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https
 ://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12973665
DTEND:20261209T020000Z
