 s! Every week we will have a study room available to any Pre-Health stude
 nts\, lots of whiteboards\, whiteboard markers\, and the chance to meet p
 eople in your classes\, or be a place for your study group to get togethe
 r. Our weekly study nights may include snacks\, tea\, mindful moments\, a
 nd more.\n \nWe are here to help you and are open to your suggestions!\n 
