DESCRIPTION:Join us for food and fun at Bridgework\, a monthly leadership 
 and team-building series designed to helps students strengthen their abil
 ity to collaborate in their organizations and communities.\nWhether you'r
 e leading a student org\, supporting a team\, or just getting started\, B
 ridgework offers practical tools and powerful insights to help you build 
 better bridges—between people\, ideas\, and action.\n📅 February 10th\, 2
 027⏰ 6:00 PM – 8:00 PM📍 IMU Frangipani Room\n \nBridgework Takeovers\nIs
  your student organization looking for a specific topic to be covered dur
 ing one of our eight sessions? Suggest a topic by emailing hwienke@iu.edu
 . A takeover does not make your workshop exclusive to your group but it d
 oes make it more customized to your group's needs. Takeovers are exclusiv
 e to one group per Bridgework event and include: choice of topics and cho
 ice of activities and games. \nFebruary Takeover Group: Unclaimed\n \nAll
  Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\, cult
 ural\, and historical observances welcome all IU students and other membe
 rs of the Indiana University community.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Un
 ion\, Student Involvement and Leadership\n\nAdditional Information can be
  found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12631396
