DESCRIPTION:Anyone can volunteer at IU Cinema! As a volunteer usher\, you 
 assure our patrons have an exceptional experience. Sometimes that means g
 reeting patrons warmly\, scanning their tickets\, and handing out program
 s. Other times\, you will answer questions about IU Cinema and its films\
 , address patron feedback\, or ensure patron comfort and safety during sc
 reenings.  \nFor more details\, check out our Volunteer Information page.
  Contact aclouden@iu.edu with any questions.\n\nHosted by: \n\nAdditional
  Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/129210
 34
